    "。你的 BMI 超过 %@，为了避免目标高得吃不下，按 BMI %@ 对应的体重 %@ 公斤来算：" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ". Your BMI is above %1$@, so to keep the target realistic it uses the weight for a BMI of %2$@, which is %3$@ kg:"
