    "先发到本 App 的服务器，再由服务器转交给 Anthropic。结果只发回你的手机。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It goes to this app's server, which passes it on to Anthropic. Results are sent back only to your phone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先发到本 App 的服务器，再由服务器转交给 Anthropic。结果只发回你的手机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先填份量、再填热量，之后改份量时，热量和三大营养素会按比例一起变；直接改某一项，就只改那一项。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter the portion first, then the calories. After that, changing the portion scales calories and macros together; changing any other value changes only that value."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先填份量、再填热量，之后改份量时，热量和三大营养素会按比例一起变；直接改某一项，就只改那一项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
