    "可以先按这个目标吃 2～3 周，看两周的平均体重再小幅调整。减脂时如果每周下降超过体重的 1%，每天多吃 150～200 千卡，或把活动量调高一档。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Try this target for 2–3 weeks, then make small adjustments based on your two-week average weight. If you're losing fat and dropping more than 1% of your body weight a week, eat 150–200 kcal more a day or move your activity level up one step."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以先按这个目标吃 2～3 周，看两周的平均体重再小幅调整。减脂时如果每周下降超过体重的 1%，每天多吃 150～200 千卡，或把活动量调高一档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
