    },
    "拍照识别、生成食谱和推荐下一餐会用到 AI。关闭后，用到 AI 前会先问你；手动记录不受影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photo analysis, recipes and next-meal suggestions use AI. When this is off, you'll be asked before AI is used. Manual logging isn't affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拍照识别、生成食谱和推荐下一餐会用到 AI。关闭后，用到 AI 前会先问你；手动记录不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拍照识别、生成食谱和推荐下一餐，是由 Anthropic 公司的 Claude AI 完成的。第一次使用前，请先看看会发送哪些内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photo scanning, recipe generation and next-meal suggestions are powered by Claude, an AI from Anthropic. Before you use them for the first time, here's what gets sent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拍照识别、生成食谱和推荐下一餐，是由 Anthropic 公司的 Claude AI 完成的。第一次使用前，请先看看会发送哪些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拍照识别：你选的餐食照片（同一餐最多 4 张）。上传前会缩小并重新压缩，不带拍摄地点等信息。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photo scan: the meal photos you choose (up to 4 for one meal). They're resized and re-compressed before upload, without the location or other photo details."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拍照识别：你选的餐食照片（同一餐最多 4 张）。上传前会缩小并重新压缩，不带拍摄地点等信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按三大营养素算约 %@ 千卡，和填写的热量差得比较多，可以再核对一下。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Based on protein, carbs and fat, this is about %@ kcal, quite different from the calories entered. You may want to double-check."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按三大营养素算约 %@ 千卡，和填写的热量差得比较多，可以再核对一下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按你的每日目标和饮食偏好，生成早餐、午餐和晚餐。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
